title: "Mathematical Internal Paradoxes, Real-Machine Autopsies, and Closed-Form Counterexamples for the 17.37M-Line GRH Lean 4 Formalization, 13.00M-Line FLT Lean 4 Formalization, and Co-Author 79-Page Navier-Stokes Finite-Time Blow-Up Paper Proof"
