abstract: >-
  Bilingual (English and Chinese) mathematical audit, real-machine Lean 4 kernel
  and declaration-graph autopsy, and closed-form counterexample suite for (1) the
  17,374,215-line Generalized Riemann Hypothesis (GRH) Lean 4 formalization, (2)
  the 13,004,119-line Fermat's Last Theorem (FLT) Lean 4 formalization, and (3)
  the co-author's simultaneously released 79-page Navier-Stokes finite-time
  blow-up paper proof.
